h generation repairable smartphone from Dutch company Fairphone. It keeps\u2014and builds on\u2014the same part modularity and easy repairability as previous generations, e.g., easily-replaceable batteries, screens, ports, and cameras. Fairphone has been continually committed to <a href=\"https:\/\/support.fairphone.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/115001041206-Find-fix-an-issue-yourself\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">supporting DIY repair<\/a>, and this continues into the 6th generation.<\/p>\n\n<p>The Fairphone 6 features a 6.31-inch LTPO OLED display, a Snapdragon 7s Gen 3, a 50 MP Sony camera, and customizable back cover accessories.<\/p>\n\n<p>The Fairphone 6 is available in Black, Green, or White colorways.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"clearer\"><\/div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section_Identification\" title=\"Link to this section\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span    class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https:\/\/fontawesome.com License - https:\/\/fontawesome.com\/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135.6 0c-35.7-35.7-37.6-92.9-4.4-130.9l4.7-5.4c8.7-10 7.7-25.1-2.3-33.9s-25.1-7.7-33.9 2.3l-4.7 5.4c-49.8 57-46.9 142.9 6.6 196.4c56.2 56.2 147.3 56.2 203.5 0L580.3 267.2zM59.7 244.8C3.5 301 3.5 392.1 59.7 448.2c53.6 53.6 139.5 56.4 196.5 6.5l6.1-5.4c10-8.7 11-23.9 2.3-33.9s-23.9-11-33.9-2.3l-6.1 5.4c-38 33.2-95.2 31.3-130.9-4.4c-37.4-37.4-37.4-98.1 0-135.6L207 165.4c37.4-37.4 98.1-37.4 135.6 0c35.7 35.7 37.6 92.9 4.4 130.9l-5.4 6.1c-8.7 10-7.7 25.1 2.3 33.9s25.1 7.7 33.9-2.3l5.4-6.1c49.9-57 47-142.9-6.5-196.5c-56.2-56.2-147.3-56.2-203.5 0L59.7 244.8z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/a><h2 id=\"Section_Identification\" class=\"header\">Identification<\/h2><\/div>\n\n<p>You can identify the Fairphone 6 by its triple camera array, &quot;fairphone&quot; text near the bottom, and two exposed Torx screws near the middle seam. &quot;<strong>Model FP6<\/strong>&quot; is printed on the side rail.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"clearer\"><\/div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section_Technical_Specifications\" title=\"Link to this section\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span    class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https:\/\/fontawesome.com License - https:\/\/fontawesome.com\/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135.6 0c-35.7-35.7-37.6-92.9-4.4-130.9l4.7-5.4c8.7-10 7.7-25.1-2.3-33.9s-25.1-7.7-33.9 2.3l-4.7 5.4c-49.8 57-46.9 142.9 6.6 196.4c56.2 56.2 147.3 56.2 203.5 0L580.3 267.2zM59.7 244.8C3.5 301 3.5 392.1 59.7 448.2c53.6 53.6 139.5 56.4 196.5 6.5l6.1-5.4c10-8.7 11-23.9 2.3-33.9s-23.9-11-33.9-2.3l-6.1 5.4c-38 33.2-95.2 31.3-130.9-4.4c-37.4-37.4-37.4-98.1 0-135.6L207 165.4c37.4-37.4 98.1-37.4 135.6 0c35.7 35.7 37.6 92.9 4.4 130.9l-5.4 6.1c-8.7 10-7.7 25.1 2.3 33.9s25.1 7.7 33.9-2.3l5.4-6.1c49.9-57 47-142.9-6.5-196.5c-56.2-56.2-147.3-56.2-203.5 0L59.7 244.8z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/a><h2 id=\"Section_Technical_Specifications\" class=\"header\">Technical Specifications<\/h2><\/div>\n\n<p><strong>Display<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>6.31-inch 1116 x 2484 (20:9, 431 ppi) LTPO P-OLED<\/li><li>10\u2013120 Hz variable refresh rate<\/li><li>1400 nits peak brightness<\/li><li>Corning Gorilla Glass 7i<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Processor<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 3 (64-bit Kryo CPU)<\/li><li>Adreno GPU<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>RAM<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>8 GB LPDDR5<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Storage<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>256 GB internal (UFS 3.1)<\/li><li>microSD support (up to 2 TB)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Battery<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>Removable 4415 mAh Li-ion<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Cameras<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>50 MP Sony Lytia 700C main camera (with OIS)<\/li><li>13MP <em>\u0192<\/em>2.2 ultra wide camera<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Connectivity<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>Wi-Fi 6E<\/li><li>Bluetooth 5.4 LE<\/li><li>NFC<\/li><li>5G nano-SIM + eSIM<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Durability<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>IP55<\/li><li>MIL-810H<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Sensors<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>Fingerprint reader<\/li><li>Facial recognition<\/li><li>Hall sensor<\/li><li>Accelerometer<\/li><li>Barometer<\/li><li>Gyroscope<\/li><li>Compass<\/li><li>Light sensor<\/li><li>Proximity sensor<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Dimensions and Weight<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul><li>156.5 x 73.3 x 9.6 mm (6.17 x 2.89 x 0.38 in)<\/li><li>193 g (0.43 lbs)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<div class=\"clearer\"><\/div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section_Additional_Information\" title=\"Link to this section\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span    class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https:\/\/fontawesome.com License - https:\/\/fontawesome.com\/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135.6 0c-35.7-35.7-37.6-92.9-4.4-130.9l4.7-5.4c8.7-10 7.7-25.1-2.3-33.9s-25.1-7.7-33.9 2.3l-4.7 5.4c